cff-version: 1.2.0

message: >-
  If you use parts of this code, please cite the associated manuscript and this
  repository.

type: custom code

title: >-
  9.4 Tesla Dataset for Precision Retinotopy in the Human Brain: Analysis Code

abstract: >-
  Custom code for preprocessing and analyzing the  9.4 Tesla Dataset for Precision Retinotopy in the Human Brain.
  The repository contains pipelines for functional and
  anatomical preprocessing, coregistration, population receptive field
  modelling.

authors:
  - family-names: Ramadan
    given-names: Dana
    email: dana.ramadan@tuebingen.mpg.de
    affiliation: Max Planck Institute for Biological Cybernetics, Tuebingen, Germany

keywords:
  - ultra-high-field MRI
  - 9.4 Tesla
  - precision retinotopy
  - population receptive field mapping
  - pRF modelling
  - functional MRI
  - visual cortex
  - submillimeter resolution

license: MIT

